{"title":"2014 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is a square, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/5/9057d4d264f5530ac63d366089bc3c17ce5d79a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABE$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> is equilateral, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/1/8712c1ef923b8ffd7923e7e481ed3091b5944113.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AEF$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> is equilateral. What is the measure of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/f/91f0d967950b1e12a0784428a758f38fa9641462.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DAF$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each interior angle in every equilateral triangle has a measure of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/d/08d5c45388de5c75af641c046d466de3592ffa98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60^{\\circ}$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" />, and each interior angle in every rectangle has a measure of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/7/6a7dfa8a2a90d521b2b03f5b82a1fb9f85dce88c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90^{\\circ}$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" />. This means:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/9/a99c2b49446d12bed0fbb65c03c335ff7f145d63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle BAF = m\\angle BAE + m \\angle EAF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"262\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/9/0f963cb131cc6a555399d06d9bdf8f3ce67a8b0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle BAF = 60^{\\circ} + 60^{\\circ} = 120^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"230\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/9/ea9df2f7dee7ae9d29b7ea8b0e24de95d4809b2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle BAF = m\\angle DAF + m\\angle DAB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"265\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/7/2471dd1d35bde835d663b5ec875436b1c64eea61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120^{\\circ} = m\\angle DAF + 90^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"181\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/2/8129538592b2233f4256483363c9dee36a4f8b71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle DAF = 120^{\\circ} - 90^{\\circ} = \\boxed{30^{\\circ}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"243\" height=\"26\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC\" title=\"2014 CSMC\">2014 CSMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CSMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CSMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2014 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2014 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2014 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2014 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\" title=\"2014 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Senior_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Senior Competition\">CEMC Senior Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017060836\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.031 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 103/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1650/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 137/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2022/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   17.661      1 -total\n 62.28%   11.000      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n 29.95%    5.290      1 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37296:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017060836 and revision id 287955. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}